      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but it feels a bit high-level. can you go deeper into the libertarian side though? like, what are the actual philosophical justifications they use for why taxation is fundamentally wrong, beyond just saying it's \"coercion\"? i want to make sure i'm not just describing it as a preference, but as a rigorous moral position.",
